SUMMARY:Family Day
DESCRIPTION:Family Day            \n                                \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Sundays\n11:00 am – 3:00 pm\nMakerspace\, Ground Floor\nFree for kids and Gardiner Members\nIncluded with admission for adults and seniors \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Families can connect over clay in our new Makerspace with weekly activities inspired by our collection and special exhibitions\, and led by our amazing team of educators and volunteers. This summer\, we invite you to create tiny versions of everyday objects and places in clay\, inspired by our International Ceramic Art Fair. Bring the whole family and let your imagination roam! \nWe recommend bringing a recycled container or bag in which to transport your work home. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         
